  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 512.03 Export and Import Recordkeeping and Reporting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 512.03 Export and Import Recordkeeping and Reporting.\n\n(a) An exporter shall:\n\n(1) Meet the recordkeeping requirements of 40 CFR 262.83(i);\n\n(2) File an annual report with the administrator of EPA, by March 1 of each year, that is based on exports made during the previous calendar year, as specified in 40 CFR 262.83(g); and\n\n(3) In lieu of the requirements of 40 CFR 262.42, if applicable, meet the exception reporting requirements of 40 CFR 262.83(h).\n\n(b) An importer shall meet the recordkeeping requirements of 40 CFR 262.84(h).\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; amd by #7207-B, eff 2-26-00; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12347, eff 8-14-17; ss by #12922, eff 11-23-19; ss by #14280, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw500.html"
